  "contract": [
    "The16-byte float-window record holds pointer, count/capacity halfwords, decimation period/phase bytes, cursor halfword and running float sum. Preserve live reloads and ordered stores around actual C memmove, including aliased records, phase wrap and zero-divisor default semantics.",
    "Reverse weighted accumulation uses a16-bit loop index, signed wrapped available-i-1 clamping and ordered nonfused float32 multiply/add. Two25-tap filter tables match all200 stock coefficient bytes.",
    "Rolling features push the input, smooth it, subtract the delayed input, filter the residual and publish a signed-period average. Feature+80 and pair+84 descriptor periods remain distinct. Native pair reloads input1 after the feature update and preserves the70-byte shared tail behavior.",
    "No new writable owner or inline assembly. Native providers retain separate names from the portable model APIs. The existing algorithm root still imports its unfinished optical/motion accumulation parent; these helpers are dependencies, not a complete sensor engine."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "22464 direct cases plus384 independent finite Fraction weighted-sum cases and4360 lifecycle calls total27208 paired invocations. The26 lifecycle scenarios include24 manual-record sessions of160 samples and2 actual-constructor sessions of260 samples.",
    "All542 unique native instruction bytes execute, including44 entry bytes and70 shared-tail bytes for0x2fee2. Actual C memory helpers execute with no algorithm/math mocks. Constructor scenarios use actual C/native session constructors; only allocation is modeled and six allocation sizes are checked.",
    "Public RAM, full active FPSCR, saved R4-R11/S16-S31, stack and masks agree. Nine compiled defects are rejected. Source execution cannot enter stock code.",
    "Default DIV_0_TRP-disabled arithmetic, positive mapped capacities and selected aliases are the tested contract. Arbitrary malformed capacities, memory-fault atomicity, private-stack aliases, real allocator lifecycle, cold FPU, interrupts/concurrency, timing, final startup/layout and physical sensor behavior remain unverified. Weighted counts beyond65535 retain the native16-bit wrapping loop and are not treated as a supported terminating workload.",
    "906 units compile and compose;895 prior nongenerated source/object pairs unchanged. Tested object equals normal build. Imports remain88 application/22 boot. Eleven higher-level SpO2 core processing stages remain incomplete. Relocatable composition is not a bootable image."
  ],
